  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "People tend to forget that VRChat is early access and treat everything as final product\nPut this reminder at the start of the application so players have a reminder every time they change, i would even suggest adding it to the loading menus and every time an error appears on screen\n\nThis is to curb negative player behavior and have users more be more attent or forgiving of issues that may arise, similar to \"authentication failed \" issues of the Blackout of December",
